Referecences: 
Ways to use stmt$PDO:
After SQL queries with :data, :user, etc.. $stmt = $pdo->prepare
Bind values if used:
$stmt->bindValue(':data', $var);
$stmt->execute();

$stmt->fetch(), fetchAll, fetchColumn, fetchRow
OR
$stmt->execute([":data" => $var])
$stmt->fetch(), fetchAll, fetchColumn

Ternary OPT:
'Ternary vs. Null Coalescing Operator'
Ternary Opt
$a ?: $b
Returns $a if it is truly
Throw undefined errors

Null Coalescing Operator
$a ?? $b
Returns $a if it is set and not null
Can act like with auto inline isset

js:
condition ? expressionIfTrue : expressionIfFalse
const newvar var ? var : null


